---
layout: statement
---
:: kicker ::
The problem
:: title ::
PowerPoint is a format built for machines that [aren't AI.]{.accent}
:: note ::
`.pptx` is a zip of bloated, namespaced XML with absolute coordinates. AI botches it — so AI-made decks come back misaligned, off-brand, broken. You finish the job by hand.
---
layout: solution
---
:: kicker ::
The answer
:: title ::
slaide is the deck format [AI gets right.]{.accent}
:: note ::
A small, plain-text source instead of megabytes of XML. AI writes a complete deck in one pass; you review and present. The human barely touches it.
